{
  "id": "LUK.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 10",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu goojeakta fih laadam ea damanamughuush",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ng'asheesu ghwaloat Ng'utamiida fih suuk laadam ea damanamughuush, ak goojeakta gabadiina iyeenya, goosheedeawa niny, gaweay gil nyooh ea mujiini gil ea heeda wassean gasa niny gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Booga aasaang'a ak ea ng'ay fuga gadiyeeda, amwaasha Ng'utamiida bea booga goojeakta buuneeda jea ghwalach boagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aweayeena; nea goong'ulayi aba gideaba geajeakteaydaneegwa dayeega gisilga jeeda suuyeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoayaadi geadi shageeda, ghana sandakwajeanda, ghana geeka; nea adoakeacheewi siida aba naweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheeda wassean ooweayi jeeda gidamadeeda ayeena, ‘Daba gheawi hoyyoo!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iimida orjeeda hoyyoo hoowa, gayghwanyas hoyyooydeang'wa; ama mandana, abeeda gaygabiikseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goopiidi gheawi, ak gooyeagiischi nea ghoaleayi gisigooneegwa, aba gideaba siida gadiiyi gahaguuw gidageatindaanyi; adooriteawi gheawi ak gooweayi gheaw nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyoahiti mujiineeda wassean sideaptaneegwa, ayaaga gisigooneegwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oahaabwa fuga miyean mida jeedida nea goorukusi fugiga gideaba, ‘Sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA nineekiiseegwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba mujiineeda ooweayi sean ak ea mwadeaptaneegwa, goosikchi naweadingaaschi nea gooyeenyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘eara birjeanda mujiineedeang'wa noas geeshangaasa geelalaksi iheengeagwa; ak goobiissi anala gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA nineekiit.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydayeeshiineegwa, gayghoamu ghamilikghta muuchi Sodoma eaweedida ea ghang'al mujiineedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiinajeega mandeawana masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shageada, Gurasini! Shageada, Betsayda! Aba gideaba deamdeamanga ghayi sisin aba heedeang'wa inyeeda ghayi geesin aba Diro ea Sidoni, gajea goola gwaduukuuna nea gookwa guniyajeega ak goobiitpiida deareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gayghoamu ghamilikghta girgweaksiinda Diro ea Sidoni ea ghang'aleagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ang'iing'i Gapernaumu, gigasayi adiing'da geaw ea hita humng'eeda? Gajeahiing'daneey ea hita uuta ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida aleeyseegwa iit, gooleeysean iit aniini, nea dea heawaneegwa, ghaheawanaan aniini, nea dea heawanaan ghaheawa dea ghayi ajeakneani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda fuga alaadam ea damanamughuush",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiigu fuga alaadam ea damanamughuush nea gahoosan, nea gwayeena, “Ng'utamiida, eara meangeenda ghoawal gheanyangaasa aba gheawungaagu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Ghaadaahaanyi Shataani nea ghang'adaana humng'eeda gawuurji dadamandeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'ula, neagoonyeegwa gheambalmeeda jea ooleapsiinana ng'eanyi ichipkeega ea udagilbajeega, ea uurda jea oopalana weajoocheanda; nea manda gichea gwahisseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adiidu goohoosanyi aba gidawalda gheang'deang'wa meangeenda, ahoosana aba gideaba sing'waar gheawungeagwa aba humng'eeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hooseaneega Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida goohoosan Guroorooda Ghaydit ak gwayi, “Geabadiischooweey Bwaabwa, Ng'utamiida bea humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba gifunyi ng'asheesu fuga mideawa weaghuumeeda ea gea mideawa fughareenga ak giihiimsi diibiga manang'i; Asaha Bwaabwa, ada gida igassiidi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda sean nigoonan Bwaabwa; ak ea manda siinal Orjeeda geaghus Bwaabwa, ak ea manda siinal Bwaabwa geaghus Orjeeda ea siida wassean gasa Orjeeda goohiimsa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayamsa geaw ginealangaaschi ak goobalool aba makcheameeda nea gwayeesha, “Ghang'wana gheanyanga dea ng'asheega oadaayi agooga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geayeeshiineegwa, sibanga ea sugoodiga ghayi gagasa ghwadaah ng'asheesu oadaayiin ak ea mwadaaha, nea gagasa ghwayiiy gea oayiinyi ak ea mwayiinya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala siida miy bea Samariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada diinagiida ak gwasimsim nea gwayeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, gay dasin naaha iijea danyas eaweega manda muudeanooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Geang'waar naaha aba jeeda deaweeda? heapi giisoamwandiin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Bwariinya ASEETA was Ng'utamiidaang'u aba gurooroadaang'u sean, ea aba jeadaang'u sean, ea aba uurdaang'u sean, ea aba fughareadaang'u sean; ea giischeewoocheandaang'u gawuurji gida ibwariiydi geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Asi girgu huumwa; una sina ng'asheesu, abeeda gaynyasa giibinda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagasa ghoahiimda doobiiwnataanyi ak gwayeesha Yesu, “Neada giischeewoocheandeanyu ea ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ghayi ghwararang'aana sih Yerusalemu nea gawa Yeriko, ak goobissa geatinga mareanghooga, ak geareat hang'weaka nea geabwar, ak gaweay nea gwanung'usa heeda nea niriikghta ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gheamamda ghwararang'aana naweedida ashoohoocheanda diineeda Yahudi; dea siidida ghwasajaadawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eara siispa Lawi was bareanyeanda gweadu naweeda, ama hita hooweani ghwadaah ak ghwasajaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu siispa Samariya was bareanyeanda, gweadu naweeda ama hita hoowa mida siidideani; ghwadaah ak ghabwayda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaweesa ak ghwayeasha deaneaduutka nagheeda nea ghwayiin difaayi ak ghwarat ama hit goodiing'da badayda digeeda ak ghwaat ea ghoahiita gheeda roocha rabasta ak ghoarear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gageanu lapiyeeda siguura dinaari iyeenya ak ghoadaw siida bea gheeda ak gwayeesha, ‘Areara siisi, ama shoada gil aba giireerda, abeeda gaydaanyiit iyeabiigu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ulayi heapi aba jeedeaba fiisu asamwaguun, giischeewoocheandeaba siisi abissa geatinga mareanghoogean aneeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Dea ghwanyawa bwayda gil.” Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Eara ang'iing'i una ak gisindunu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabareasa Marta ea Mariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gudeenda naweeda, gaweay ak ghwahita jeemba gharang'i, mida gatmooni siguura Marta, ghwadeapta ak ghwaat Yesu gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda hutpa ghaamwat siguura Mariya, apteada aba madeeda Yesu nea gooleeysiit giinealshoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwadeawiit Marta muuchi aba gadiyoojiga saang'a; gaweesa niny ak gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida miduupi gideaba ghwanung'wanaan hudiyya gadiyeeda nea gabwageawi? Rukusiina ghwaan ghaweadan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Ng'utamiida nea gwayeesha, “Marta, Marta gihashi nea giideawiidi aba ng'asheega saang'a; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gidasigasa ea agi ak ghwahit. Mariya ea niloat gidamiy majeamu eegeandeawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
